sequenceDiagram
    participant User as User / SRE
    participant OC as OpenShift CLI<br/>(oc)
    participant K8s as Kubernetes API Server
    participant Pod as must-gather Pod<br/>(ephemeral)
    participant Gather as gather.sh<br/>Orchestrator
    participant XKS as xks_util.sh<br/>Distribution Detection
    participant Collectors as 14+ Component<br/>Collector Scripts
    participant Common as common.sh<br/>run_mustgather()
    participant Disk as must-gather/<br/>Output Directory

    User->>OC: oc adm must-gather --image=<must-gather-image>
    OC->>K8s: Create temporary pod<br/>with service account token
    K8s-->>Pod: Pod created with<br/>mounted SA token

    Pod->>Gather: Execute gather.sh

    Gather->>XKS: Detect Kubernetes distribution
    XKS-->>Gather: OpenShift / AKS / CKS / EKS

    alt OpenShift Distribution
        Gather->>K8s: oc adm inspect<br/>operator, monitoring, applications,<br/>notebooks, model-registries,<br/>ingress, kuadrant namespaces
        K8s-->>Gather: Namespace resources & logs

        Gather->>K8s: Collect DSCI, DSC, component CRs,<br/>webhook configs, gateway classes
        K8s-->>Gather: Custom resources

        Gather->>Collectors: Dispatch 14 component scripts<br/>(parallel background processes)

        par Parallel Collection
            Collectors->>K8s: Discover namespaces<br/>where target CRDs exist
            K8s-->>Collectors: Namespace list

            Collectors->>Common: run_mustgather()
            Common->>K8s: Collect namespace logs,<br/>custom resources,<br/>Gateway API & Istio resources
            K8s-->>Common: Resources & logs
            Common-->>Collectors: Collection complete
        end

        Collectors-->>Gather: All collectors finished<br/>(with failure tracking)

    else Non-OpenShift (xKS)
        Gather->>Collectors: Dispatch llm-d collection only<br/>(optional: WVA, batch gateway)
        Collectors->>K8s: kubectl get resources
        K8s-->>Collectors: Resources
        Collectors-->>Gather: Collection complete
    end

    Gather->>Disk: Write results to must-gather/
    Gather->>Disk: Flush to disk
    Gather->>User: Print summary report
